diff --git a/FUN_MENU_BUILD.md b/FUN_MENU_BUILD.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8809cae
--- /dev/null
+++ b/FUN_MENU_BUILD.md
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# iOS integrated fun-menu build
+
+This private build adds an in-game floating **菜单** button and five opt-in
+features. All switches default to off:
+
+- 无限阳光
+- 植物无冷却
+- 种植不耗阳光
+- 自动收集
+- 游戏加速（2x）
+
+The floating button can be dragged anywhere within the game screen; a short
+tap opens or closes the panel. The iOS build requests a Retina drawable and
+fills the display, with touch coordinates mapped back to the 800x600 game UI.
+
+The menu consumes touches inside its panel, so taps do not reach plants or
+coins behind it. Conveyor-belt and slot-machine seed behaviour is kept intact.
+
+Owner-provided game data is stored under `ios/BundledResources/` and copied
+into the app at build time. On iOS, files manually placed in the app's
+Documents directory take precedence over bundled data. Save data remains in
+Documents.
+
+Build on macOS with Xcode 15+, CMake 3.21+, and vcpkg:
+
+```sh
+export VCPKG_ROOT=/path/to/vcpkg
+./ios/build-ios.sh Release
+```
+
+The unsigned result is `build-ios/pvz-portable-ios.ipa`. It must be signed
+before installation.
